entries[298995] = { ["name"] = "Abyssal Alchemist Stone", ["text"] = "3 sec cast\nReagents:\nZin'anthid (150), Anchor Weed (50), Expulsom (30)\nCreate an Abyssal Alchemist Stone.\nProfession:\nBattle for Azeroth Alchemy (165)\nTrainer:\nNarv\nZone:\nNazjatar\nCost:\n1\n5\n\nAbyssal Alchemist Stone\nBinds when picked up\nUnique-EquippedTrinket\n+ 10 Versatility\n\nPrismatic Socket\n\nEquip: When you heal or deal damage you have a chance to increase your Strength, Agility, or Intellect by 27 for 15 sec. Your highest stat is always chosen.\nEquip: Increases the effect that healing and mana potions have on the wearer by 40%. This effect does not stack.\n50\nRequires Kul Tiran Alchemy\n(165)\n\"Can be used for transmutations in place of a Philosopher's Stone.\"" }
